Package: SurplusProductionModel
Type: Package
Title: Pella-Tomlinson Surplus Production Model for Antarctic Toothfish
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alistair", "Dunn", 
           email = "alistair.dunn@example.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: 
    A state-space spatial Pella-Tomlinson surplus production model for 
    Antarctic toothfish (Dissostichus mawsoni) stock assessment. This package 
    provides the MVP foundation for the ATO rTMB project, implementing 
    biomass-based assessment with spatial structure and shape parameter 
    flexibility. Includes Schaefer (m=2) and Fox (m=1) as special cases.
